Thank you Iñaki for your prompt response.
Let me ask you for some more advice, the reason I liked the idea of cloning is because attributes are assigned randomly (I missed to mention this on my previous post) so if I clone every arrival I will have an exact copy of every arrival.  This arrivals do share resources but I am using resources only for counting or accruing number of times it is used but my resources are set to infinity capacity so arrivals are not fighting for resources.
So maybe your last option to run two simulations is good. I am assuming each arrival will have the same values as each simulation will used the same seed, is that right?  My only concern with that is that it takes twice the time as using clones, any ideas on how to speed it up?

